---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FigLine from '../components/figures/FigLine.astro';

const bookUrl = 'https://calendar.notion.so/meet/cameronearloliver/qc3y04oud';

const patterns = [
  'Founders making every decision themselves because nobody else had the context.',
  'Teams working hard but not on the same thing.',
  'Revenue unpredictable because nobody understood how the business actually created value.',
  'Owners carrying the anxiety of the entire company on their shoulders.',
];
---

<Layout
  title="About Cameron Oliver | Growth Map"
  description="Cameron Oliver is an operator, not a theorist. A decade inside fast-growing companies, from employee #3 to 100+, usually the person leaders called when things started breaking."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="px-6 pb-16 pt-20 md:pb-20 md:pt-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] text-center">
      <h1 class="font-display text-[38px] leading-[1.1] sm:text-[46px] md:text-[54px]">
        I'm an operator, <em class="whitespace-nowrap">not a theorist</em>.
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-7 max-w-[52ch] text-[18px] leading-[1.65] text-fern">
        A decade inside fast-growing companies, from employee #3 to 100+, usually the person leaders called when things started breaking.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-[760px]">
      <img src="/images/about-photo.jpeg" alt="Cameron Oliver" class="w-full rounded-[20px] shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(20,38,26,.14)]" loading="eager" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW I GOT HERE -->
  <section class="bg-parchment-deep px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[720px]">
      <h2 class="font-display text-[32px] leading-[1.15] md:text-[38px]">How I got here.</h2>
      <p class="mt-7 text-[18px] leading-[1.7] text-fern">
        I started in project management and grew into operations. Along the way I learned to build what's called an operating model. It's basically a project plan, but for a business: how you get customers, what it takes to serve them, and the rhythm that keeps it all running.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[18px] leading-[1.7] text-fern">
        I love operations and making the thing work, mainly because I hate waste. And after a decade of it, the same pattern kept showing up everywhere I looked.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-9 space-y-4">
        {patterns.map((p) => (
          <li class="flex gap-3.5 rounded-[18px] bg-white p-5 text-[16.5px] leading-snug text-forest">
            <span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-semibold text-rust">&times;</span><span>{p}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE LINE -->
  <section class="bg-forest px-6 py-20 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] text-center">
      <p class="font-display text-[28px] leading-[1.3] text-white md:text-[34px]">
        Every one of those companies thought it had a revenue problem. Almost every one had an operating problem wearing a revenue costume.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-7 text-[18px] leading-relaxed text-white/75">
        Growth Map exists to find that problem, and then fix it with you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHERE THIS GOES -->
  <section class="px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px]">
      <h2 class="font-display mx-auto max-w-[22ch] text-center text-[32px] leading-[1.15] md:text-[40px]">
        You don't run a factory. But your business works <em>like one</em>.
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-7 max-w-[58ch] text-center text-[18px] leading-relaxed text-fern">
        Whatever you sell, it's the same line. You just put your own words on the stations.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-12 overflow-x-auto rounded-[18px] bg-parchment-deep p-6 md:p-10">
        <div class="min-w-[620px]"><FigLine /></div>
      </div>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-9 max-w-[58ch] text-center text-[18px] leading-relaxed text-fern">
        Each station is a question you should be able to answer yes to. The one you can't is where the money leaks, and it's where we start.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-parchment-deep px-6 py-20 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[640px] text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-[32px] leading-[1.15] md:text-[40px]">Which station is yours?</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-[18px] leading-relaxed text-fern">
        Tell me where it's stuck and I'll tell you what I'd go after first.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3.5">
        <a href={bookUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="rounded-full bg-moss px-8 py-4 text-[15px] font-semibold text-white transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">Book a call</a>
        <a href="/results" class="rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-forest bg-white px-8 py-4 text-[15px] font-semibold text-forest transition-colors hover:bg-forest hover:text-white">See the results</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
